<title>USA: AgriGeneral sees OSHA fine of more than $1 mln.</title>
<headline>AgriGeneral sees OSHA fine of more than $1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>CROTON, Ohio 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>AgriGeneral Co LP said Monday it expected the U.S. Occupational Safety and Health Administration to fine the company more than $1 million for alleged violations of employee, safety-training and respiratory rules.</p>
<p>The company said OSHA has completed a five-month review that covered health and safety conditions at its facility in Croton.</p>
